{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31473","headline":"登章华楼 · 李羣玉","name":"登章华楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚子故宫地，苍然云水秋。\n我来览从事，落景空生愁。\n伯业没荆棘，雄图成古丘。\n沈吟问鼎语，但见东波流。\n征鸿引乡心，一去何悠悠。\n晴湖碧云晚，暝色空高楼。\n迢遰趋远峤，微茫入孤舟。\n空路不堪望，西风白浪稠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31473.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31473","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}